Generic single-database configuration.

versions/ holds one .py file per schema change. Ordering comes from the
down_revision chain inside the files, not from their filenames.

Generate a new one with:

    alembic -c src/models/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

Autogenerate diffs src/models against a live database, so DATABASE_URL must
point at a reachable instance. Always review the generated file before
running it -- autogenerate does not catch every kind of change.
